Subject: [PATCH] refactor(memory): bound PR authority to receipts

---
 CHANGELOG.md                                  |   2 +-
 packages/memory/src/pr-lifecycle-authority.js | 187 +-----
 .../test/pr-lifecycle-authority.test.js       | 625 +-----------------
 3 files changed, 65 insertions(+), 749 deletions(-)

